OL,3,ATribute paid to 'bravest' woman who
OL,4,Adied of 'stab wounds' after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTribute has been paid to a woman who
OL,7,Fcrashed a car into a wall after
OL,8,Fallegedly being stabbed.
OL,10,FEleanor Barnfield, 47, died in hospital
OL,11,Fafter police were called to the crash
OL,12,Fin Bridgend on Monday, where they found
OL,13,Fshe had "puncture wounds unrelated to
OL,14,Fthe collision", which the BBC
OL,15,Funderstands were sustained in a
OL,16,Fstabbing.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
