OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATribute paid to 'bravest' woman who
OL,4,Adied of 'stab wounds' after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 61-year-old man from Bridgend has
OL,7,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,8,Fafter a "significant" police operation
OL,9,Fat a retirement housing complex run by
OL,10,FValleys to Coast, and remains in
OL,11,Fcustody.
OL,13,FEleanor, who worked for the housing
OL,14,Fassociation, has been described by her
OL,15,Ffamily as the "kindest, most loving,
OL,16,Fbravest person in the world".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
